{"unit_id": "HYY-King__dsh-plugin-auditor#card-zh", "repo": "HYY-King/dsh-plugin-auditor", "commit": "e8a2fe99e460b1fdf3d42640f26760ea327846d0", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-plugin-auditor 是面向 DSH profile 的插件组合检查工具，通过 DSH 工具接口提供 audit_plugins 调用。它读取 profile 的 package.json、cordis.patch.yml 和已安装插件主入口，检查重复工具名、bundle entry id 冲突、DeepSeek peer 版本不匹配、多个记忆插件以及渠道插件凭据提示；也可按新插件包名生成冲突预览。适合在调整插件组合前查看静态检查结果。默认检查 ~/.dsh/profiles/web，也可传入其他 profileDir；不需要额外配置。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:121-181", "lib/index.js:264-342"]}
{"unit_id": "HYY-King__dsh-plugin-auditor#card-en", "repo": "HYY-King/dsh-plugin-auditor", "commit": "e8a2fe99e460b1fdf3d42640f26760ea327846d0", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-plugin-auditor checks DSH profile plugins with the audit_plugins tool. It reports duplicate tool names, entry ID collisions, peer version mismatches, multiple memory plugins, and possible missing channel credentials. It can preview a proposed package name. Default profile: ~/.dsh/profiles/web.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:121-181", "lib/index.js:264-342"]}
